    "Three timed samples per workload were collected within one process after warmup, not three independent boots or benchmark sessions.",
    "Ubuntu baseline used GCC 13.3.0, OpenSSL 3.0.13 and CMake Release; this Yocto build uses GCC 15.3.0, OpenSSL 3.5.8 and an empty CMake build type with CPU -O2 and CUDA host -O2. Its generated nvcc command has no explicit optimization-level flag. This is not an OS-only comparison.",
